        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Loksatta\n- Places: Mumbai, Pune, Nagpur, Ahmednagar, Aurangabad, Delhi, Aurangabad Division, Marathwada region\n- People: Malik Amber\n- Topics: publishing locations, city titles, city founding\n\nFacts:\n- Loksatta is published from Mumbai, Pune, Nagpur, Ahmednagar, Aurangabad, and Delhi.\n- Aurangabad is the administrative headquarters of the Aurangabad Division, also known as the Marathwada region.\n- Aurangabad is titled \"The City of Gates.\"\n- Malik Amber founded Aurangabad in 1610.\n- Aurangabad completed 400 years in 2010.",
